{"e":{"Berolinismus":[{"p":"noun","g":"m","i":"/beʁoliˈnɪsmʊs/","a":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/40/De-Berolinismus.ogg/De-Berolinismus.ogg.mp3","s":[["Berlinism (expression in the Berlin vernacular)",[],[["Innstetten, unbestritten, ist ein famoses Menschenexemplar, Mann von Charakter und Schneid, aber die Briests—verzeih den Berolinismus, Luise—, die Briests sind schließlich auch nicht von schlechten Eltern.",""]]]],"fm":[["Berolinismus","genitive"],["Berolinismen","plural"],["Berolinismus","nominative singular"],["Berolinismen","definite nominative plural"],["Berolinismus","genitive singular"],["Berolinismen","definite genitive plural"],["Berolinismus","dative singular"],["Berolinismen","dative definite plural"],["Berolinismus","accusative singular"],["Berolinismen","accusative definite plural"]],"et":"Latin Berolinum (“Berlin”) + -ismus"}]},"f":{"berolinismen":[["Berolinismus","plural"],["Berolinismus","definite nominative plural"],["Berolinismus","definite genitive plural"],["Berolinismus","dative definite plural"],["Berolinismus","accusative definite plural"]]},"x":{}}